# Judge Runbook

1. View Statistics – Check volunteer counts, attendance, vacancies, and understaffed locations.
3. Manage Volunteers – View volunteer details, assignments, and availability.
4. Check-in / Check-out – Test attendance tracking and timestamp updates.
5. Location Staffing – Verify staffing requirements, assigned volunteers, and vacant slots.
6. Additional Features – Explore calendar, comments, and coordination tools.
7. Export Data– Export volunteer and attendance records for external use.
8. Verify Updates – Check whether attendance changes reflect in staffing statistics.
9. Reset Demo – Restore the initial demo state for another testing session.
